{"title":"Hot Limit","artist":"T.M.레볼루션","sourceId":"reference:l8IvTz4XZe1KUarXUCa7","sourceHash":"b1e7e1ec2ca3527734dcaf9eeab04c33a0be26b32c710662074ea1ac5b7e5017","performanceStatus":"reference_timing","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","referenceProvider":"LRCLIB","referenceId":33351274,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":16.71,"end":20.17,"text":"YO! Say, 夏が 胸を刺激する","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":20.17,"end":23.62,"text":"ナマ足魅惑のマーメイド","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":23.62,"end":27.02,"text":"出すとこ出して たわわになったら","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":27.02,"end":31.58,"text":"宝物(ホンモノ)の恋は やれ 爽快っ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":37.65,"end":40.96,"text":"ゴマカシきかない 薄着の曲線は","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":40.96,"end":44.57,"text":"確信犯のしなやかな style","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":44.57,"end":47.79,"text":"耐水性の 気持ちに切り替わる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":47.79,"end":51.58,"text":"瞬間の眩しさは いかがなもの","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":51.58,"end":58.12,"text":"ココロまで脱がされる 熱い風の誘惑に","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":58.12,"end":63.32,"text":"負けちゃって構わないから 真夏は","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":63.32,"end":67.28,"text":"不祥事も キミ次第で","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":67.28,"end":70.48,"text":"妖精たちが 夏を刺激する","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":70.48,"end":74.1,"text":"ナマ足 魅惑のマーメイド","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":74.1,"end":77.5,"text":"出すとこ出して たわわになったら","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":77.5,"end":82.24,"text":"宝物の恋が できそうかい?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":88.26,"end":91.43,"text":"キミじゃなくても バテぎみにもなるよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":91.43,"end":95.16,"text":"暑いばっかの街は 憂鬱で","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":95.16,"end":98.32,"text":"隙を見せたら 不意に耳に入る","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":98.32,"end":102.05,"text":"サブいギャグ なんかで涼みたくない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":102.05,"end":108.75,"text":"むせかえる熱帯夜を 彩る花火のように","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":108.75,"end":112.28,"text":"打ち上げて散る想いなら","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":112.28,"end":117.67,"text":"このまま抱き合って 焦がれるまで","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":117.67,"end":121.36,"text":"妖精達と 夏をしたくなる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":121.36,"end":124.67,"text":"熱い欲望はトルネイド","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":124.67,"end":128.06,"text":"出すもの出して 素直になりたい","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":128.06,"end":132.93,"text":"君と僕となら it's alL right","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":159.42000000000002,"end":166.11,"text":"都会の ビルの海じゃ 感じなくなってるキミを","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":166.11,"end":171.35,"text":"冷えたワインの口吻(クチヅケ)で 酔わせて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":171.35,"end":175.24,"text":"とろかして 差し上げましょう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":175.24,"end":178.68,"text":"妖精達が 夏を刺激する","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":178.68,"end":181.95,"text":"ナマ足 ヘソ出し マーメイド","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":181.95,"end":185.59,"text":"恋にかまけて お留守 に なるのも","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":185.59,"end":189.12,"text":"ダイスケ的にも オールオッケー!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":189.12,"end":192.68,"text":"YO! Say, 夏を 誰と したくなる?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":192.68,"end":196.03,"text":"一人寝の夜に you can say goodbye","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":196.03,"end":199.38,"text":"奥の方まで 乾く間ないほど","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":199.38,"end":202.4,"text":"宝物の恋をしま鮮花？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}